@startuml "Dual Architecture Component Diagram - Admin vs Front-End"

<style>
componentDiagram {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #334155
    LineColor #475569
    FontName "Inter", "Segoe UI", sans-serif
    FontSize 12
    
    component {
        BorderThickness 1.5
        FontColor #1E293B
        BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    }
    package {
        BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
        BorderColor #94A3B8
        FontColor #0F172A
        FontStyle bold
    }
    database {
        BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
        BorderColor #D97706
    }
}
</style>

header Alpha Engine Architectural Isolation: Dual Scope Architecture
title Isolamento de Arquitetura entre Painel Administrativo e Front-End E-Commerce

package "1. Escopo Painel Administrativo (Namespace Alpha\\Admin\\...)" #E0F2FE {
    [AdminSessionMiddleware] as AdminMW <<Middleware>> #BAE6FD
    [AdminAuthService] as AdminAuth <<Auth Service>> #BAE6FD
    [BaseController] as BaseCtrl <<Template Method / Abstract>> #7DD3FC
    [AdminProductAction] as AdminAction <<Action (extends BaseController)>> #38BDF8
    
    note bottom of BaseCtrl #F0F9FF
        **Herança BaseController:**
        Expõe helpers utilitários:
        - getRepository()
        - getMapper()
        - getTemplate()
        - remember() [Cache]
        - renderPosition()
    end note
}

package "2. Escopo Front-End E-Commerce (Namespace Alpha\\Controller\\...)" #DCFCE7 {
    [LanguageMiddleware] as LangMW <<Middleware>> #86EFAC
    [SessionMiddleware] as UserMW <<Middleware>> #86EFAC
    [CustomerAuthService] as CustomerAuth <<Auth Service>> #86EFAC
    [ShowProductAction] as FrontAction <<Action (implements ActionInterface)>> #4ADE80
    
    note bottom of FrontAction #F0FDF4
        **Injeção de Construtor Pura:**
        NÃO estende BaseController.
        Recebe dependências explicitamente
        via construtor (DI PSR-11):
        - TwigEnvironment
        - ProductRepository
        - SeoUrlRepository
    end note
}

package "3. Core Compartilhado (DDD Core)" #FFF9C4 {
    interface "ActionInterface" as ActionContract <<Interface>> #FDE047
    [RepositoryFactory] as RepoFactory <<Factory>> #FDE047
    [MapperFactory] as MapperFactory <<Factory>> #FDE047
    [AppContainer (PSR-11)] as Container <<Container>> #FACC15
}

package "4. Armazenamento de Sessões & Persistência" #FEE2E2 {
    database "Redis (sessao:admin:*)" as AdminRedis #FCA5A5
    database "Redis (sessao:cliente:*)" as CustomerRedis #FCA5A5
    database "MySQL 8.0" as MySQL #FEF3C7
}

' --- Conexões do Painel Admin ---
AdminMW --> AdminAuth : Valida permissões
AdminAuth --> AdminRedis : Grava/Lê 'sessao:admin:{id}'
AdminAction --|> BaseCtrl : Herança estrita
AdminAction ..|> ActionContract : Implementa contrato
BaseCtrl --> RepoFactory : Atalho getRepository()
BaseCtrl --> MapperFactory : Atalho getMapper()
Container ..> AdminAction : Injeta dependências

' --- Conexões do Front-End ---
LangMW --> FrontAction : Injeta 'lang', 'cart_count' e traduções
UserMW --> CustomerAuth : Valida rotas /account/*
CustomerAuth --> CustomerRedis : Grava/Lê 'sessao:cliente:{id}'
FrontAction ..|> ActionContract : Implementa contrato
Container ..> FrontAction : Injeção direta no Construtor
FrontAction --> RepoFactory : Acessa via Repositories injetados

' --- Persistência Compartilhada ---
RepoFactory --> MySQL : Leitura e Gravação unificada
MapperFactory --> MySQL : Persistência SQL

@enduml
